: "worldwide"}}, {"id": 884954, "platform": 14, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 884955, "platform": 3, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1793744, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g28.jpg"}, {"id": 1793745, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g29.jpg"}, {"id": 1793746, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g2a.jpg"}, {"id": 1793747, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g2b.jpg"}, {"id": 1793748, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g2c.jpg"}], "slug": "hardtrace", "summary": "Hardtrace is a Czech arcade game that defines \"couch vs. couch multiplayer.\" It builds on fifty years of evolution of tron-like and snake-like games, but brings significant improvements and changes in gameplay. Up to twelve players can play on one PC (Windows, Linux, macOS) or up to fourteen over a network. With one click on Steam, you're in the arena, thanks to Steam multiplayer support.\n\nBattles await you, where precise route planning and quick reactions are crucial. You control the Tracer vehicle, which leaves a deadly trail behind it, and a collision means the loss of unsaved points. Portals, acceleration, smashing, chasing teammates, and collecting their points \u2014 all this leads to a single goal: victory. In Hardtrace, the entire match is decided in the final seconds...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hardtrace", "videos": [{"id": 177480, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "JWDCgzpeQdU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JWDCgzpeQdU", "title": "Hardtrace Official Trailer - Local couch multiplayer party game, arena for 2-12 players, PVP, Coop", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JWDCgzpeQdU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}